{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMatches"},{"type":"text","value":" hook returns the router's complete presented array of "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteMatchType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteMatch"}]},{"type":"text","value":" objects "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"regardless of its caller's position in the component tree"}]},{"type":"text","value":". The array can include still-loading descendants or matches below a pending/error/not-found render boundary."}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"tip","title":"Tip","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you only want the parent or child matches, then you can use the "},{"type":"link","href":"./useParentMatchesHook.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParentMatches"}]},{"type":"text","value":" or the "},{"type":"link","href":"./useChildMatchesHook.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChildMatches"}]},{"type":"text","value":" based on the selection you need."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usematches-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useMatches options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMatches"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts a single "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"optional"}]},{"type":"text","value":" argument, an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(matches: RouteMatch[]) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the route matches and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMatches"},{"type":"text","value":". This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.structuralSharing"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/render-optimizations.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render Optimizations guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for more information."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usematches-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useMatches returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided, the return value of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided, an array of "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteMatchType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteMatch"}]},{"type":"text","value":" objects."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useMatches } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const matches = useMatches()\n  //     ^? [RouteMatch, RouteMatch, ...]\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"usematches-options","text":"useMatches options","level":2},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","text":"opts.structuralSharing option","level":3},{"id":"usematches-returns","text":"useMatches returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useMatches` hook returns the router's complete presented array of [`RouteMatch`](./RouteMatchType.md) objects **regardless of its caller's position in the component tree**. The array can include still-loading descendants or matches below a pending/error/not-found render boundary.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> If you only want the parent or child matches, then you can use the [`useParentMatches`](./useParentMatchesHook.md) or the [`useChildMatches`](./useChildMatchesHook.md) based on the selection you need.\n\n## useMatches options\n\nThe `useMatches` hook accepts a single _optional_ argument, an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Optional\n- `(matches: RouteMatch[]) => TSelected`\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the route matches and the return value will be returned from `useMatches`. This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useMatches returns\n\n- If a `select` function is provided, the return value of the `select` function.\n- If no `select` function is provided, an array of [`RouteMatch`](./RouteMatchType.md) objects.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useMatches } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const matches = useMatches()\n  //     ^? [RouteMatch, RouteMatch, ...]\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useMatchesHook\ntitle: useMatches hook\n---\n\nThe `useMatches` hook returns the router's complete presented array of [`RouteMatch`](./RouteMatchType.md) objects **regardless of its caller's position in the component tree**. The array can include still-loading descendants or matches below a pending/error/not-found render boundary.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> If you only want the parent or child matches, then you can use the [`useParentMatches`](./useParentMatchesHook.md) or the [`useChildMatches`](./useChildMatchesHook.md) based on the selection you need.\n\n## useMatches options\n\nThe `useMatches` hook accepts a single _optional_ argument, an `options` object.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Optional\n- `(matches: RouteMatch[]) => TSelected`\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the route matches and the return value will be returned from `useMatches`. This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useMatches returns\n\n- If a `select` function is provided, the return value of the `select` function.\n- If no `select` function is provided, an array of [`RouteMatch`](./RouteMatchType.md) objects.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useMatches } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const matches = useMatches()\n  //     ^? [RouteMatch, RouteMatch, ...]\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
